    "result_text": "The AcceptanceTest (the only test class) is the full suite, and both its tests pass. \n\nThe change is complete. I implemented the `contactPreference` rule with three edits:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `contactPreference` field to the `Owner` schema, an enum of `EMAIL`/`PHONE` (this generates `OwnerDto.ContactPreferenceEnum`).\n\n2. **`OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` expression that derives the value: `EMAIL` when `owner.getEmail()` is non-null and non-blank, otherwise `PHONE`.\n\nThe existing responder pipeline (`RespondWithOwner`/`RespondWithOwnerCreated` \u2192 `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto`) then serves the field on `GET /api/owners/{id}`. Both `corePhoneWhenNoEmail` and `functionalityEmailWhenPresent` pass, and the build is green.",
